{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Conjecture","doco:Section"],"label":"conj:joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified","kind":"conjecture","title":"Joint Galois $\\times$ braid action commutes on the figure-8 bi-filtration cell — verified directly","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-joint-galois-braid-action","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hq-bi-filtration"],"tags":["joint-action","figure-8-knot","self-conjugate-cell","verification","graded-mikusinski","theorem-level"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.JointGaloisBraidFigure8.figure_8_joint_action","text":"joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"conj:joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified\"></a><p>The joint motivic-Galois <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\times</code> braid-group action conjecture (<a href=\"#conj:joint-galois-braid-action\">Joint motivic-Galois <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\times</code> braid-group action on the bi-filtration <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n, K)}</code></a>) predicts commutativity on each <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n, K)}</code> stratum. This prediction is verified on the figure-8 row <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(2, 4_1)}</code> by direct computation.</p>\n<p>The figure-8 bi-filtration cell is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(2, 4_1)} \\subseteq G^{(2)}(\\mathcal{H}_q)</code>, with dominant cell <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_K = (2, 2)</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_4(q)</code> and shape parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z_K = \\zeta_6 = e^{i\\pi/3}</code>.</p>\n<p>The two group actions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_{\\mathrm{mot}} \\supseteq \\langle * \\rangle</code> (bar): <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">*: q \\mapsto q^{-1}</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_6 \\mapsto \\zeta_6^{-1}</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">B_4 \\to H_4(q)</code>: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1, \\sigma_2, \\sigma_3</code> act by conjugation in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_4(q)</code>, fixing central idempotents.</li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified.md","heading":"Conjecture","number":"21.4.21","page":"b/conj-joint-galois-braid-figure-8-verified","qa":{"counts":{"pass":85,"fail":3,"warn":0,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BringsSurface.JointGaloisBraidFigure8.figure_8_joint_action","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/JointGaloisBraidFigure8.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
